{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12226770","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226770","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1222677001:1":{"text":"Here's the boat. You can board, but you'll need to pay for a ticket.","source_cn":"船就在这里，你可以上船。当然，你得付船票的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7579ECC070CE85B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222677002:1":{"text":"Payment? But you don't want money.","source_cn":"钱？不，你不想要钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A934AB349C5864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222677003:1":{"text":"What's your price?","source_cn":"说吧，我需要支付什么代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4946074593F7A74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222677004:1":{"text":"You're perceptive. I like that.","source_cn":"聪明，我喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DD212528A9E67B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222677005:1":{"text":"I want you to deliver a message to the one you serve, the \"Fallen King\".","source_cn":"帮我传个口信，带给你背后的主人——那位骸骨之王。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8B1CE6C94A8EFB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222677006:1":{"text":"Tell him that <style=\"highlight\">the relic isn't in Rustport anymore</style>.","source_cn":"你告诉他，<style=highlight>班题斯圣器...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3BCF17E932EBBF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222677007:1":{"text":"Even if he sends more assassins, it won't matter. It'll only cost him.","source_cn":"就算他派人来也毫无意义，只会得不偿失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40F734A4DD16B617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222677008:1":{"text":"Fine... I'll pass it on, but I can't guarantee what happens next.","source_cn":"好……我会转达，但我不许诺结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CDEE0BD82EE58A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222677009:1":{"text":"That's fine. If your king insists on coming, Rustport won't just sit and wait to be crushed.","source_cn":"没关系，如果你的雇主不依不饶，锈锚港也不会坐以待毙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7FD2AA8A336A9EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222677010:1":{"text":"I'll pass that along, too.","source_cn":"这一句，我也会一并转达。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE1368B7FA6A084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222677011:1":{"text":"But... I'm curious. Why?","source_cn":"但……我很好奇，为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32DB31C27F5AE69B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222677012:1":{"text":"Why am I letting you go free, or why did I ask you to send a message?","source_cn":"为什么放了你？还是，为什么让你带口信？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B7025D212A7ECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222677013:1":{"text":"Both. I could twist your words, stir up chaos.","source_cn":"都有。我说不定会偷换口信的内容，煽风点火。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C058A697627A45C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222677014:0":{"text":"Or I could return with the king's legions and bring Rustport to its knees.","source_cn":"也有可能，我会带着骸骨之王的亡灵军团重返锈锚港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6343C7F7285B3E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222677015:1":{"text":"You must understand, the Dead Tide Fleet is a mere shadow when measured against the might of the king's army.","source_cn":"区区死潮舰队，根本无法与那位君王座下的亡灵军团相提并论。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB3DD337D38AC8D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222677016:1":{"text":"Wow, this is the first time I've seen you talk this much. Hah!","source_cn":"原来你能一次性说这么多话啊，哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F618BED763D1C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222677017:1":{"text":"And here I thought you had an illness where saying more than a few words might kill you.","source_cn":"还以为你得了一次多说几句话就会死掉的病。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC81998054F51125","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222677018:1":{"text":"Though, I guess a Graveborn can't die twice, huh?","source_cn":"不过，亡灵也不会再死一次了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FB6CA214756F460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222677019:1":{"text":"Huh?\nGraveborn don't get ill...","source_cn":"……？\\n亡灵，不会生病。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3BCD01BEF3CC3A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222677020:1":{"text":"And they don't have a sense of humor either.","source_cn":"亡灵也没有幽默感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA84217FEA3F3FFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222677021:1":{"text":"You still haven't answered my question.","source_cn":"你还没有回答我的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D389F41CCEDB19A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222677022:1":{"text":"... If you're asking why, it's because once, I had a woman in my life. Someone very important to me.","source_cn":"……问原因的话，因为我生命里也有一位重要的女性。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495BCFD028A53D28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222677023:1":{"text":"I'm human, but she... became a Graveborn. Our time together was far from pleasant, but it's a time I'll never forget...","source_cn":"我是人类，而她，成为了亡灵。我们的相处称不上愉快，但…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57AD2F731D8976DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222677024:1":{"text":"I don't know your reason for saving Nalianne, but it's clearly something you stand by, isn't it?","source_cn":"我不知道你对女性手下留情的原因，至少，那是你行动的某种...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF787EE2DCBEFEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222677025:1":{"text":"Even when you were risking your life and the relic, you wouldn't break that principle.","source_cn":"当你面临性命之危和圣器被夺的风险时，你也不愿意改变自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC2276FDABE7B24A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222677026:1":{"text":"She's just a regular person, and yet, you let yourself be captured to save her.","source_cn":"那对你而言，只是个有着一面之缘的普通人，你却愿意为了救...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5857C0C4FC5F9453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222677027:1":{"text":"A Graveborn who holds onto her principles like that... is someone worth trusting. That's how I see it.","source_cn":"一个能够坚定原则的亡灵，她的承诺值得信任——我是这么想的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C218BD0334149C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1222677028:1":{"text":"And hey, I'm a woman too. Does that mean I'm excluded from your principles?","source_cn":"说到底，我也是个女性，难道我被排除在你的原则之外吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA983EBA8E531F92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222677029:1":{"text":"A woman? Could've fooled me.","source_cn":"女性？看不出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF81A1D5BCC2D93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222677030:1":{"text":"... That was a bad joke.","source_cn":"……刚才那一句，是开玩笑的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7DF21B74991D022","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1222677031:1":{"text":"Heh. Maybe your sense of humor isn't completely dead, after all.","source_cn":"呵……我收回那句评价，你的幽默感不多，但起码不为零。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE18136AA6F01E000","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222677032:1":{"text":"Alright, on the boat.","source_cn":"好了，上船吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5E19AC05F2933BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1222677033:1":{"text":"Just like I'm trusting Rustport's future to you, I'll be trusting the Void Relic to another reliable person.","source_cn":"就像我把锈锚港的命运托付给你一样，班题斯圣器我也会托付...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x384213FF13074387","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1222677034:1":{"text":"Make sure to pass that on to your king, too.","source_cn":"这个消息，也别忘了告诉那位君王。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF65545069809816D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1222677035:1":{"text":"You're speaking of that magister, aren't you?","source_cn":"是那个魔法师吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF144C9195CCC31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1222677036:1":{"text":"Well, I can't say.","source_cn":"不便透露。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A338225F12BD4CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1222677037:1":{"text":"I understand...","source_cn":"我知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA18B36BCA8F0A18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:44:12602503:0":{"text":"After watching Silvina board the ship, Sonja turns her gaze to you.","source_cn":"索尼娅目送西尔维娜上了船，转身把目光移向你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EC3B76E47ADC890","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:西尔维娜":{"text":"Silvina","source":"西尔维娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":43,"localized_text_count":38,"speaker_count":3}}